  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "しおを　ふきだして　えものに　あびせしおづけにしてしまう。　たいないのすいぶんを　うばってしまうのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "분출한 소금을 먹이에게 끼얹어서 소금절이로 만들어 버린다. 체내의 수분을 빼앗는 것이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會將鹽噴向獵物，將其做成醃漬物。獵物體內的水分會在醃漬過程中被奪走。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il projette du sel pour en recouvrir ses proies. Celles-ci subissent alors un processus de salaison et se déshydratent.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Um seine Beute einzupökeln, überschüttet es sie mit Salz, das es auf sie spuckt. Dieser Prozess entzieht dem Körper der Beute Wasser.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Escupe sal para recubrir con ella a sus presas y someterlas a un proceso de salazón que extrae la humedad de sus cuerpos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Spruzza sale addosso alla preda fino a ricoprirla del tutto per estrarne i liquidi corporei.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon dry cures its prey by spraying salt over them. The curing process steals away the water in the prey’s body.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "塩を　噴き出して　獲物に　浴びせ塩漬けにしてしまう。　体内の水分を　奪ってしまうのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "朝着猎物喷出盐，并将其做成盐腌物。猎物体内的水分会在此过程中被夺走。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Escupe sal para recubrir con ella a sus presas y someterlas a un proceso de salazón que extrae la humedad de sus cuerpos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "たいないで　がんえんを　あっしゅく。かためた　しおのたまを　うちだすとてっぱんも　つらぬく　いりょく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "몸속에서 암염을 압축시킨다. 이렇게 굳혀진 소금 탄환을 발사하면 철판도 관통하는 위력을 보인다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會在體內壓縮岩鹽形成硬梆梆的鹽彈。一旦發射，其威力就連鐵板都能貫穿。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il compresse du sel gemme à l’intérieur de son corps et tire des balles de sel durci capables de transpercer des plaques de fer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In seinem Körper komprimiert es Steinsalz zu harten Salzgeschossen. Wenn es diese abfeuert, durchdringen sie selbst Eisenplatten.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Comprime sal de roca en el interior del cuerpo y crea unos proyectiles salinos capaces de perforar placas de metal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Comprime salgemma all’interno del corpo per creare proiettili salini, che spara con una potenza tale da trafiggere lastre di ferro.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It compresses rock salt inside its body and shoots out hardened salt pellets with enough force to perforate an iron sheet.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "体内で　岩塩を　圧縮。固めた　塩の弾を　撃ちだすと鉄板も　貫く　威力。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在体内压缩岩盐，以此形成坚硬的盐弹，发射后的威力连铁板都能贯穿。",
      "language": {
